{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103934","id":2383282002,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6ODf9S","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103934","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103934.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103934.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103934","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103934/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103934/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103934/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/44408eabaabbc4faeb8c5bb808885a3a600e4408","number":103934,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Forward+: Replace the current BRDF approximation with a DFG LUT and add multiscattering energy compensation","user":{"login":"LiveTrower","id":48926464,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4OTI2NDY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48926464?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower","html_url":"https://github.com/LiveTrower","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"### **DFG LUT**\r\nThis PR replaces the approximation described [here](https://www.unrealengine.com/en-US/blog/physically-based-shading-on-mobile) with an analytical approximation described in [real shading](https://www.gamedevs.org/uploads/real-shading-in-unreal-engine-4.pdf), but only for Forward+ rendering.\r\nThis implementation takes the approach of generating a 16-bit 128x128 DFG LUT with 1024 samples using a compute shader, and it also includes a modification described by [google filament](https://google.github.io/filament/Filament.html#toc5.3.4.7).\r\n| Original DFG | Multiscattering DFG |\r\n|----------|----------|\r\n| ![DFG_Original](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4a91bc0e-3079-4dd1-a4dc-e5727c858b87) | ![DFG_Multiscattering](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/33e3f04e-c362-4c34-aea9-fbedbcf3bf99) |\r\n\r\nFinally, this DFG LUT also has the DG term of the cloth BRDF included in the blue channel for future implementation of [cloth model](https://google.github.io/filament/Filament.html#materialsystem/clothmodel).\r\n![BRDF_Cloth](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f0371c40-08d8-4728-b4d1-e44c85799da6)\r\n\r\nHere are some images to compare before and after:\r\n\r\n| Before | After |\r\n|----------|----------|\r\n| ![BRDF_APPROX](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c0ebdd2f-f112-48c2-a4f3-01fbbf855a12) | ![BRDF_DFG_LUT](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0b1ac9c5-ff11-4a7f-b83f-8594efdfcc1a) |\r\n\r\nNote: This PR only replaces the approximation in Forward+ rendering, as the current approximation is more suitable for renders like Mobile and Compatibility.\r\n\r\n### **MULTISCATTERING**\r\nThis PR also implements multiscattering by integrating Filament’s [Energy preservation](https://google.github.io/filament/Filament.html#materialsystem/improvingthebrdfs/energylossinspecularreflectance).\r\n\r\nHere is a comparison between single scattering and multiscattering:\r\n| Single Scattering | Multiscattering |\r\n|----------|----------|\r\n|![Single scattering](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/36b64526-5029-4977-b3ce-ba2f3ab40f09)|![Multiscattering](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0c28b26e-1519-4096-b56c-eb107947848a)|\r\n|![Single scattering(dark bg)](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/163d4f08-a398-46c5-8ab1-a8149921473b)|![Multiscattering(dark bg)](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/38e016ef-a6e8-40b7-8faf-f97818745165)|\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\ncloses: godotengine/godot-proposals#4508","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","number":22,"state":"closed","title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users